--- find unknown predicate ---
1:16: error: find: unknown predicate '-bogus'.
     1 |  koshkit find . -bogus
       |                 ^~~~~~
note: Use `-name`, `-iname`, `-type`, `-maxdepth`, `-mindepth`, or `-print`.
--- find missing -name argument ---
1:16: error: find: -name expects a pattern.
     1 |  koshkit find . -name
       |                 ^~~~~
note: Pass a glob after `-name`, e.g. `-name '*.c'`.
